{"title":"2008 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A <i>magic square</i> is a grid of numbers in which the sum of the numbers in each row, in each column, and on each of the two main diagonals is equal to the same number (called the <i>magic constant</i>). \n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1a\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Problem 1a</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1a\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A magic square is to be formed using the nine integers from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/b/efbfe273946ff9f971c5eab331ca39caa6fdf7f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Parts\">Parts</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Parts\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1a_Part_i\" title=\"2008 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1a Part i\">2008 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1a Part i</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1a_Part_ii\" title=\"2008 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1a Part ii\">2008 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1a Part ii</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1a_Part_iii&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2008 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1a Part iii (page does not exist)\">2008 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1a Part iii</a></li></ul>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017215428\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.028 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 36/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 964/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 344/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.302      1 2008_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1\n100.00%   14.302      1 -total\n 43.74%    6.255      1 Template:Image_needed\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37003:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017215428 and revision id 285955. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}